Iridite Mutual is a bank in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. It issues bank cards, and its headquarters keeps an automagic teller machine behind the heaviest guard in the city. [[Org/Roundhat Gang/People/Hlarf|Hlarf]] carried one of its cards. [[Smiler]] read it as holding 900 gold and took fifty for drawing the money out.
